        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">To reduce methane emission the stock container is covered, to reduce NH3 emissions the digested matter will be spread with a trail hose.\n\n# Included processes\nThis process contains the infrastructure, the energy used and the emissions of the fermentation process.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
